{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/669c8a47c32bd1efcd013b331bbbb5b1.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" width=600 height=235 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/669c8a47c32bd1efcd013b331bbbb5b1.webm?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a warm, flour-dusted world where pan dulce takes center stage. Merge adorable conchas, cuernitos, and more to discover delicious new treats in this whimsical puzzle game. With a dash of strategy and a sprinkle of tradition, PancitoMerge blends the joy of classic falling block games with the vibrant spirit of a neighborhood panader\u00eda. Great for cozy breaks or climbing the leaderboards, no baking skills required! *Caution - May cause sudden cravings for pan dulce.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bready, Set, Merge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/9e05a578e918e2ec87fb5693770b9ab6.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/9e05a578e918e2ec87fb5693770b9ab6.webm?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/9e05a578e918e2ec87fb5693770b9ab6.mp4?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: merge matching breads to create higher-level ones, aiming for the highest score possible while unlocking every type of bread in a single run. But be careful, the game ends if the breads stack up to the top of the bag!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tasty Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/e11b65270e000a57aad592212bee5dd3.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/e11b65270e000a57aad592212bee5dd3.webm?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/e11b65270e000a57aad592212bee5dd3.mp4?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 5 drops, a customer arrives with a specific bread request. Fulfill their order by clicking/tapping on the requested bread in the bag.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rooted In Tradition, Baked With Love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/246f4aeec11f4a5471b65856a69e25df.avif?t=1774187239\" width=1440 height=1440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PancitoMerge</i> is a love letter to Mexican culture and the joy of pan dulce. From colorful conchas to buttery cuernitos, each bread is inspired by real treats found in local bakeries, celebrating the warmth, tradition, and creativity of Mexican baking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea for the project started when F\u00e1yer (the game director) saw Vanila's pan dulce illustrations, he made a note about making a game that used that art, possibly on a casual puzzle like suika. Then, a whole year after, he found himself with some free time and decided to prototype the concept. He then reached out to Vanila to invite her to collab on it and she really liked the prototype, so they both started working on the web version. The main plan was to make it and if people liked it enough, they would see if it made sense to make it into something bigger. People really liked so here we are working on a bigger version for all of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/574d32a55e84f5559dcbc246d32495d3.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/574d32a55e84f5559dcbc246d32495d3.webm?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/574d32a55e84f5559dcbc246d32495d3.mp4?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature-Filled and Oven-Ready\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming Mexican bakery theme with authentic breads to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet addictive gameplay with a strategic customer mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick sessions or long playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new bakeries that have different themes, breads and customers!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/64930c5c7d0027a0b162b62596913360.webp?t=1774187239\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/64930c5c7d0027a0b162b62596913360.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=235 /></picture></span></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ojo de Buey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/311514930f5fa2688928b94c9aa0cc69e78412cb.jpg"},{"name":"Orejita","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/354d0e8c6dd87d325495b07bdbff395483a8d97d.jpg"},{"name":"Pan de Muerto","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/16e0c1afffaf65254ba8a547e9422dec8676e721.jpg"},{"name":"Welcoming our Ancestors","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/0f7cd1a9ccb469581648e1fb44008733b888573f.jpg"},{"name":"Pan de Carita","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/9d13897a221c3a27e5469cdf9f34c9ed1dedc14e.jpg"},{"name":"Pan de Animas Mixteca","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/f731838f893ea1e9f93516c21ad00abf354eeec9.jpg"},{"name":"Pan de Muerto Bordado","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/97ed8b6c889d3a1582468657e6aa5e2eaef42086.jpg"},{"name":"Konnichiwa Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/d41c5532e5eb193663ffe686df1912e392017d29.jpg"},{"name":"Melonpan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/8cd35a350fd3482d04e78cc9a05f22f696a74a1c.jpg"},{"name":"Bola de Berl\u00edn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3655610/d5252375068e35ea9b0b93fa27aefc82c5f3b3c6.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655610?t=1774187239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655610?t=1774187239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/00cc7360efc008deb15784039f920e77d8c993e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774187239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/00cc7360efc008deb15784039f920e77d8c993e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774187239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3775730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/669c8a47c32bd1efcd013b331bbbb5b1.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" width=600 height=235 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/669c8a47c32bd1efcd013b331bbbb5b1.webm?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a warm, flour-dusted world where pan dulce takes center stage. Merge adorable conchas, cuernitos, and more to discover delicious new treats in this whimsical puzzle game. With a dash of strategy and a sprinkle of tradition, PancitoMerge blends the joy of classic falling block games with the vibrant spirit of a neighborhood panader\u00eda. Great for cozy breaks or climbing the leaderboards, no baking skills required! *Caution - May cause sudden cravings for pan dulce.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bready, Set, Merge!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/9e05a578e918e2ec87fb5693770b9ab6.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/9e05a578e918e2ec87fb5693770b9ab6.webm?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/9e05a578e918e2ec87fb5693770b9ab6.mp4?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple: merge matching breads to create higher-level ones, aiming for the highest score possible while unlocking every type of bread in a single run. But be careful, the game ends if the breads stack up to the top of the bag!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tasty Twist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/e11b65270e000a57aad592212bee5dd3.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/e11b65270e000a57aad592212bee5dd3.webm?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/e11b65270e000a57aad592212bee5dd3.mp4?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 5 drops, a customer arrives with a specific bread request. Fulfill their order by clicking/tapping on the requested bread in the bag.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rooted In Tradition, Baked With Love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/246f4aeec11f4a5471b65856a69e25df.avif?t=1774187239\" width=1440 height=1440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>PancitoMerge</i> is a love letter to Mexican culture and the joy of pan dulce. From colorful conchas to buttery cuernitos, each bread is inspired by real treats found in local bakeries, celebrating the warmth, tradition, and creativity of Mexican baking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The idea for the project started when F\u00e1yer (the game director) saw Vanila's pan dulce illustrations, he made a note about making a game that used that art, possibly on a casual puzzle like suika. Then, a whole year after, he found himself with some free time and decided to prototype the concept. He then reached out to Vanila to invite her to collab on it and she really liked the prototype, so they both started working on the web version. The main plan was to make it and if people liked it enough, they would see if it made sense to make it into something bigger. People really liked so here we are working on a bigger version for all of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/574d32a55e84f5559dcbc246d32495d3.poster.avif?t=1774187239\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/574d32a55e84f5559dcbc246d32495d3.webm?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/574d32a55e84f5559dcbc246d32495d3.mp4?t=1774187239\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feature-Filled and Oven-Ready\u00a0\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A charming Mexican bakery theme with authentic breads to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet addictive gameplay with a strategic customer mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for quick sessions or long playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new bakeries that have different themes, breads and customers!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655610/extras/64930c5c7d0027a0b162b625969133